== Effects ==
* Spawns 6 blue [[wisps]].
** Each wisp has its own 10% chance to instead be a random wisp.

== Synergies ==
* {{i|BFFS!}}: Doubles the base damage, contact damage, and damage scaling per floor of the wisps.
* {{t|Forgotten Lullaby}}: Doubles the wisps' fire rate.
* {{t|Baby-Bender}}: Wisp shots become homing shots.

